[META]
framework: claude-framework
file_id: QUICK_LINKS
class: custom
version: 1.0.0

[QUICK_LINKS]
overview: Fast navigation to important files and concepts

[CORE_LAYER]
# Note: the "core" static lib lives under core/core/ ; the "engine" lib under core/engine/.
# There is NO top-level Engine/ or Editor/panels/ — see EDITOR_LAYER below.

ECS Framework:
  → core/core/ecs/include/snk/ecs/ecs_system_interface.hpp (empty system_interface base)
  → core/core/ecs/include/snk/ecs/ecs_system.h (system_factory, register_system with {phase, after, before, run_in_edit})
  → core/core/ecs/include/snk/ecs/ecs_traits.hpp (function_traits, is_view)
  → core/core/ecs/include/snk/ecs/ecs_entity.h (entity helpers)

Resource System:
  → core/core/resource/include/snk/resource/res_system.h (resource_system: load/caching)
  → core/core/resource/include/snk/resource/res_tag.h (res::tag; single-arg parses protocol from string)
  → core/core/resource/adapters/ (Assimp/stb/text adapter pipeline)
  → core/core/resource/resolvers/ (VFS resolvers, e.g. res_vfs_resolver)

Descriptor System:
  → core/core/desc/include/snk/desc/desc_system.h (desc::desc_system)
  → core/core/desc/include/snk/desc/desc_base.hpp (descriptor base)
  → docs/epics/desc-driven/ (architecture docs)

Command Registry:
  → core/core/command/include/snk/command/cmd_registry.h (cmd::command_registry: id, JSON schemas, invoke; main thread only)
  → core/core/command/include/snk/command/cmd_main_thread_queue.h (cmd::main_thread_queue: post from any thread, run by the ds::task_system main drain)
  → core/core/command/include/snk/command/cmd_json_schema.h (cmd::json_schema: schema subset validator)

Memory Allocators:
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/mem_allocator.h (ds::frame_allocator(), frame_allocator_reset())
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/mem_linear_allocator.h (custom scope)
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/mem_pool_allocator.h (O(1) alloc/free)
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/mem_stack_allocator.h (LIFO markers)

Logging / Assert:
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/logger/engine_log.h (egLOG_* macros, namespace eg = engine)
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/engine_assert.h (ASSERT_MSG/ASSERT_FAIL, _DEBUG only)

Configuration:
  → core/core/config/include/snk/config/cfg_api.h (config API)

Application:
  → core/core/application/include/snk/application/app_module_interface.h (module_interface lifecycle, depends_on)
  → core/core/application/include/snk/application/app_module_loader.hpp (register/initialize/shutdown_all_services)
  → core/core/common/include/snk/common/ds/ds_store.hpp (ds::app_data_storage service locator DI)

[ENGINE_LAYER]
Scene Management:
  → core/engine/scene/include/snk/scene/level/scn_context_set.h (scn::context_set; for_each = id order)
  → core/engine/scene/include/snk/scene/level/scn_world_context.h (scn::world_context: one world)
  → core/engine/scene/include/snk/scene/level/scn_set_channel.h (blackboard + mail between contexts of a set)
  → core/engine/scene/include/snk/scene/level/scn_context_manager.h (level load, context sets)
  → core/engine/scene/include/snk/scene/scn_ecs_assembler.h (desc → ECS registry assembly)

Rendering Pipeline:
  → core/engine/render/render_system/include/snk/render/rnd_render_system.h (render system)
  → core/engine/render/render_system/include/snk/render/rnd_frame_assembler.h (frame assembly)
  → core/engine/render/render_system/passes/ (z_prepass, opaque, skybox, transparent, composition, debug)
  → core/engine/scene/include/snk/scene/level/scn_render_data_extractor.h (geometry→render_packet)
  → core/engine/scene/level/scn_render_data_extractor.cpp (also extracts lights→packet)

Animation & Skinning:
  → core/engine/scene/scn_animation_* , scn_skinning_desc.* (EPIC-33)
  → core/engine/render/render_system/skinning/ (rnd::skinning_manager)

Input System:
  → core/engine/input/include/snk/input/inp_input_system.h , inp_ecs_input_manager.h , inp_input_router.h

GUI:
  → core/engine/gui/gui_system/ (gui::system, ImGui integration)

[EDITOR_LAYER]
# Editor sources live under Editor/code/editor_system/ — see Editor/CLAUDE.md for the
# full controller/panel decomposition. There is NO Editor/panels/ or Editor/editor_app.h.
Main Editor:
  → Editor/main.cpp (module bootstrap: Core → Engine → Editor)
  → Editor/config/editor.cfg (settings; resource.path = ../res/)
  → Editor/code/editor_system/controller/edt_editor_system.cpp/h (coordinator)
  → Editor/code/editor_system/controller/edt_level_controller.cpp/h (level I/O, derive_world_arrays)

ImGui Panels: (Editor/code/editor_system/panels/, all extend edt::panel_base)
  → edt_inspector_panel.h
  → edt_scene_hierarchy_panel.h
  → edt_asset_browser_panel.h
  → edt_prefab_editor_panel.h (EPIC-25)
  → edt_viewport_panel.h , edt_console_panel.h , edt_dockspace.h

Gizmo Transform:
  → Editor/code/editor_system/gizmo/edt_transform_gizmo.hpp (pure ImGui DrawList)

Input / File Dialog:
  → Editor/code/editor_system/input/edt_input_manager.h , edt_input_binding.h , edt_file_dialog.h

[DESCRIPTOR_FILES]
Level & World:
  → Editor/res/levels/ (.desc level files)
  → Editor/res/templates/ (desc templates)

Objects & Assets:
  → Editor/res/objects/ (imported objects / prefab descs)
  → Editor/res/assets/ (editor layer, wins) , core/res/shaders/ , core/res/skybox/ (engine base layer; res:// = core/res under Editor/res)

[BUILD_SYSTEM]
Main CMake:
  → CMakeLists.txt (root)
  → core/CMakeLists.txt (adds core/core + core/engine targets)
  → Editor/CMakeLists.txt

Build Output:
  → build/Editor/ (editor build artifacts)
  → build/unit_tests.exe (test executable; Windows/Ninja)

[TESTING]
Test Suite:
  → tests/ (all test files)
  → Build: cmake --preset dev-debug && cmake --build build/dev-debug (ccache + PCH via SNK_COMPILER_CACHE / SNK_PCH)
  → Run: ./unit_tests
  → Single: ./unit_tests --run_test=DSBitFlagsTests

[DOCUMENTATION]
Project Docs:
  → docs/agent/ (Claude documentation)
  → docs/agent/learning/ (self-learning guides)
  → docs/epics/ (task management)
  → docs/epics/INDEX.md (epic registry)

CLAUDE Guidelines:
  → CLAUDE.md (root, critical rules)
  → docs/agent/ARCHITECTURE.toon (system design)
  → docs/agent/CONSTRAINTS.toon (hard rules)
  → docs/agent/CODE_CONVENTIONS.toon (naming/style)

[IMPORTANT_CONCEPTS]
Frame Allocator (Memory):
  → See: CONSTRAINTS.toon [CONSTRAINT_1-3]
  → Code: core/core/common/include/snk/common/mem_allocator.h
  → Pattern: std::pmr::vector<T>(ds::frame_allocator())

Multi-World ECS:
  → See: ARCHITECTURE.toon [ECS_SYSTEM], CONSTRAINTS [13B][13C]
  → Code: core/core/ecs/ directory
  → No world limit; context_set::for_each = id order; cross-context data: docs/roadmap/design/WORLD_MESSAGING.md

Descriptor Inheritance:
  → See: ARCHITECTURE.toon [DESCRIPTOR_SYSTEM]
  → Files: level_desc → world_desc → prefab_desc
  → Hot-reload: Changes auto-apply to scenes

Resource System:
  → See: ARCHITECTURE.toon [RESOURCE_SYSTEM]
  → Tag-based: res::tag{"res://path/to/resource"} (single-arg parses protocol)
  → VFS: res:// (filesystem), memory:// (runtime)

