[COMMON_TASKS]
Add new System:
  1. File: core/engine/<module>/<prefix>_<name>_system.cpp (e.g. scn_transform_system.cpp)
  2. Inherit: ecs::system_interface (state only); logic = free/member fn
  3. Register: sfactory.register_system<&fn>(name, { .phase = ecs::phase::update, .after = {...} }[, instance])

Add new ImGui Panel:
  1. File: Editor/code/editor_system/panels/edt_<name>_panel.h
  2. Extend: edt::panel_base (on_render() body; base wraps ImGui::Begin/End)
  3. Register: add as shared_ptr member, registered via editor_context::panels().add(...) (panel_registry) and keep the returned registration

Add new Descriptor Type:
  1. File: core/engine/scene/scn_<name>_desc.h (inherit desc::desc_base)
  2. Register desc + spawner: register_scene_types in core/engine/scene/scn_registration_scope.cpp (assemble_*)
  3. Unregister: automatic (registration_scope destructor)

Load Resource:
  1. Tag: res::tag{"res://path/to/asset"}
  2. Load: resource_system&.require<T>(tag) (injected; require_sync<T> blocks; no global get_system())
  3. Wait: res_handle<T>, optional .then(callback) for async

Create Entity (data-driven):
  1. Source: prefab/world desc nodes (.desc), not code
  2. Assemble: ecs_assembler builds the registry from the world_desc
  3. Edit: Inspector or in-scene gizmo (editor re-serializes desc)

[CONFIG_REFERENCE]
Editor Config File:
  → Editor/config/editor.cfg
  → Override: --set key=value CLI args
  → Variables: CFG_VAR_DEF_* macros
